te the inner integral by integrating with respect to $y$, treating  $x$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }[{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{c}{(1+x+y)^{3}}\\,\\text{d}y]\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{[-\\frac{c}{2(1+x+y)^{2}}]}_{y=0}^{y=\\infty }\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{c}{2(1+x)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{c}{2(1+x)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={[-\\frac{c}{2(1+x)}]}_{0}^{\\infty } \\\\  & =\\frac{c}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\frac{c}{2}=1\\,⇒\\,c=2.\n$$" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346243 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346244 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346245 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346246 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346247 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1041 "selection" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346245 13194139535370 true] [17592186346242 1110 #uuid "1d436e34-c899-5f14-b432-318089e23847" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346243 1034 "3" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346243 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535370 true] [17592186346243 1111 #uuid "321b39cb-f323-586e-939f-01055e7dc783" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346244 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346244 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535370 true] [17592186346244 1111 #uuid "274d1bf4-550a-5376-af5b-69398c7a0395" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346245 1034 "2" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346245 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535370 true] [17592186346245 1111 #uuid "c12cf603-6fa4-5a75-b5ff-34e1d8e148fb" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346246 1034 "1" 13194139535370 true] [17592186346246 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535370 true] [17592186346246 1111 #uuid 